id: reduce-pm-health-linked-worktree
title: Strict PM health resolves the wrong Git root in a nested linked worktree
description: "Round EJ observed that git rev-parse --show-toplevel identifies the package worktree, while PM strict health searches for the merge fence in the enclosing checkout. PM merge install --dry-run correctly targets the package worktree. In a standalone checkout of the same staged tree, installing the merge drivers and running full strict health passes. Reproduce with a synthetic nested linked worktree and evaluate the Git-root lookup before changing package CI."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
